  "job_B8.1.4.4_20251003_114815": {
    "chunk_text": "him \u00f0yllic mete; \u00f0a wear\u00f0 Drihten yrre, & sloh \u00f0\u00e6t & hi genemdon \u00f0a stowe Gewylnunga Byrgena, \u00f0\u00e6r hi byrigdon \u00f0\u00e6t folc; & hi foron \u00f0anon & MARIA & Aaron ciddon wi\u00f0 Moyses for his Sigelhearwenan wife, & cw\u00e6don: Segst \u00f0u, spr\u00e6c Moyses so\u00f0lice w\u00e6s se bylewitesta man ofer ealle men \u00f0e on eor\u00f0an wunedon. & he cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him & to Aarone & to Marian: Ga\u00f0 ut ge \u00f0reo to \u00f0\u00e6re eardungstowe; \u00fea hi w\u00e6ron ut Nis nan man Moyses gelica, mines \u00f0eowan, on minum huse, se is me ealra getreowost. Ic sprece to him mu\u00f0e to mu\u00f0e & openlice, n\u00e6s \u00f0urh r\u00e6delsas ne \u00f0urh hiwwinge: ondr\u00e6de ge eow & he gewat yrre ongean hi, & \u00f0\u00e6t genip geswac. \u00d0a \u00e6tywde hr\u00e6dlice on Marian scinende hreofnys swa hwit swa snaw; \u00f0a Aaron hi beheold, & Moyses \u00f0a clypode to Drihtne, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Drihten God, ic bidde \u00f0e, h\u00e6l hi. Drihten him andswarode, & cw\u00e6\u00fe: Gyf hyre f\u00e6der spigette on hyre nebb, hu ne sceolde hyre huru Maria w\u00e6s belocen vii dagas butan \u00f0\u00e6re wicstowe, & \u00f0\u00e6t folc ne styrode na hwider, \u00e6r \u00feam \u00fee \u00c6FTER \u00f0am \u00f0e Moyses, se m\u00e6ra heretoga, mid Israhela folce, swa swa him God bebead, ofer \u00f0a \u00d0a dyde Moyses swa God him bebead, & sende of \ufffd",
